298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 49 0 R
/T (Three replicas can preserve availability after node failures when placed across independent failure domains, but consume roughly three times raw capacity. Strong consistency makes completed writes visible immediately but needs coordination. Eventual consistency may improve availability/latency while allowing temporary stale reads. Choose according to whether records are transactional, collaborative or archival.)
/E (Three replicas can preserve availability after node failures when placed across independent failure domains, but consume roughly three times raw capacity. Strong consistency makes completed writes visible immediately but needs coordination. Eventual consistency may improve availability/latency while allowing temporary stale reads. Choose according to whether records are transactional, collaborative or archival.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
