571 0 obj
<<
/Title (Bitmap: fast allocation and run search but uses one bit per block. Linked free list: little metadata but slow traversal. Grouping stores many free-block addresses together; counting stores a starting block and run length and is efficient for contiguous runs. For a 4 TiB disk with 4 KiB blocks: 2^30 blocks, so bitmap = 2^30 bits = 128 MiB.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 514 0 R
>>
