/Title (LOOK turns at the last pending request rather than the disk boundary; C-LOOK wraps between last and first pending requests. For this queue LOOK is 208 cylinders and C-LOOK is 322 including wrap. A simple unsorted queue needs O\(n\) to find the next request; a sorted/balanced structure can reduce selection/insertion cost, typically O\(log n\).)
